==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 38.33 seconds<sup>1,150f</sup>, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 4~16.67 seconds<sup>120f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and some [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal]] and [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed Cats]] should be enough to ensure that the enemies won't push too much. Just make sure the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]] don't get through your meatshields, and you should be fine. Use a few ranged attackers to take out the H. Nahs before they stack up.

