==Trivia==
*''Claustronyctophobia'' is not an actual word. It is a portmanteau of ''claustrophobia'' (fear of enclosed/tight spaces) and ''nyctophobia'' (fear of darkness), though the nyctophobia part may refer to the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]].
*Claustronyctophobia's Japanese name, Kurai Semai Kowai Michi (暗い・狭い・怖い道, "Dark, Cramped and Scary Road"), is a reference to "[https://youtu.be/DbDPEbhvjMQ Kurai yo semai yo kowai yo~]" (暗いよ狭いよ怖いよーっ, "It's dark, I'm cramped, I'm scared"), a famous quote by the ''[[wikipedia:Urusei Yatsura|Urusei Yatsura]]'' character [[wikia:uruseiyatsura:Shūtarō Mendō|Shūtarō Mendō]], who is both claustrophobic and nyctophobic.

